Cross-check: Fix C (font preload link removed)
----------------------------------------------------------------------
Verified the served HTML (Layout.astro) does NOT contain
  <link rel="preload" as="style" href="...IBM+Plex+Mono...">
The remaining stylesheet load uses
  media="print" onload="this.media='all'"
which is the non-blocking pattern. Browser does not warn because the
preload is no longer present.

Conclusion
==========
All three fixes (A: mobile table overflow, B: listener cleanup,
C: redundant font preload removal) verified. Console is clean across
